          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Choose physical invigoration or mental invigoration, and add the listed conditions to those you can choose for an invigorating elixir you create to counteract:</p>\n<p><strong>Physical Invigoration</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Deafened], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Drained], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Paralyzed], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]</p>\n<p><strong>Mental Invigoration</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Confused], controlled, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fleeing], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Paralyzed], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed].</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> You can select this feat a second time to choose a different type of invigoration and add its options to those you can choose.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "maxTakable": 2,
          "prerequisites": {
